BO_ 525 RPDO1_ControlVelocity: 6 Master
 SG_ Controlword : 0|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" Drive
 SG_ TargetVelocity : 16|32@1- (1,0) [-2147483648|2147483647] "rpm" Drive

BO_ 781 RPDO2_ControlTorque: 4 Master
 SG_ Controlword : 0|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" Drive
 SG_ TargetTorque : 16|16@1- (1,0) [-32768|32767] "permille" Drive

BO_ 397 TPDO1_StatusVelocity: 6 Drive
 SG_ Statusword : 0|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" Master
 SG_ VelocityActual : 16|32@1- (1,0) [-2147483648|2147483647] "rpm" Master

BO_ 653 TPDO2_StatusTorque: 5 Drive
 SG_ Statusword : 0|16@1+ (1,0) [0|65535] "" Master
 SG_ TorqueActual : 16|16@1- (1,0) [-32768|32767] "permille" Master
