CM_ "CANopen node 13 (BLDC drive). PDO mapping: canopen/od/bldc_drive.eds (0x1600-0x1601, 0x1A00-0x1A01).";
CM_ BO_ 128 "SYNC from the master; TPDOs follow it only when 0x1800/0x1801 sub 2 is 1..240.";
CM_ SG_ 525 Controlword "0x6040";
CM_ SG_ 525 TargetVelocity "0x60FF, profile velocity (mode 3)";
CM_ SG_ 781 TargetTorque "0x6071, permille of 0x6076 rated torque (mode 4)";
